   "textLength": 280,
   "text": "Saturday September 19, 2026 6:00 am PDT by MacRumors Staff\nAll of Apple's products introduced at last week's event with the exception of the iPhone Duo are now available, with the iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max, Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4, and AirPods 5 all launching on Friday.",
